  "dataUse.prompt.title": "Improve the product with this company\u2019s work",
  "dataUse.prompt.body": "The text of what agents are asked and what they answer, so the product gets better at this kind of work. This is the company\u2019s material rather than yours, so the choice belongs to the company and needs the right permission to change. Nothing is kept under it yet: the setting is here and the retention behind it is not built.",
