  // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  // Voice mode.
  //
  // `console.voice.disclosure` IS A LEGAL SENTENCE AND NOT A GREETING. EU AI Act
  // Article 50 obliges a provider to ensure a person is informed they are
  // interacting with an AI system, and this is that sentence. It is SPOKEN as
  // the first turn and written into the transcript, so a recording of the
  // conversation carries the disclosure rather than leaving a transcript with no
  // sign that one side was a machine. Translating it into a friendlier greeting
  // in any language removes the disclosure while leaving the key.
