  "console.source.untrusted": "These pages were written by whoever owns that site. Orvay fences them before a model sees them, and nothing in them can widen what Orvay is allowed to do.",
  "console.source.no-index": "Orvay can read a site you name. It cannot search the open web yet: that needs a search index, which is the one part of this nobody can self-host.",
  "console.source.title": "What this was built from",
