  "console.memory.title": "What Orvay remembers",
  "console.memory.lead": "When a piece of work produces a document, Orvay keeps its conclusion here. When you ask something, it reads the few entries closest in meaning to your question.",
  "console.memory.not": "It does not learn from this conversation. Your messages are kept so you can read them again, and they are never turned into facts here.",
