  "billing.reset.heading": "Your plan credits reset every month",
  "billing.reset.p1": "This period ends {date}, when the invoice renews. The allowance resets to {credits} credits on that date and does not roll over: whatever is left of it is gone. It is included compute for a month of service rather than a balance you own. One date does both jobs, so the allowance can never reset on a schedule your invoice does not share.",
  "billing.reset.p2": "Prepaid credits work the other way. They are yours from the moment you pay, they survive every renewal, and each pack stays spendable for {months} months from the day it was bought. The allowance is spent first and packs afterwards, soonest expiry first, so nothing perishable is left to expire while something you paid for sits unused.",
  "billing.change.heading": "Change plan",
  "billing.change.p1": "Every plan is billed monthly, per organization rather than per seat, and includes the credits shown. Members, departments, concurrent runs and which features each plan carries are deliberately not repeated here: one page of numbers cannot go stale, and two can.",
  "billing.change.pricingLink": "See every limit on the pricing page",
