  "billing.bought.heading": "Packs you have bought",
  "billing.bought.label": "Prepaid credit packs",
  "billing.bought.row": "{left} of {total} credits left",
  "billing.topup.heading": "Automatic top up",
  "billing.topup.p1": "You can ask us to buy another pack when your spendable credits fall below a number you choose. You pick the pack, and you pick the most times it may buy one in a single billing period. That last number is your cap, and nothing overrides it. It is off until you switch it on, and it never switches itself on.",
